+// A user-confirmed subset from one source profile. An absent selection keeps
+// the legacy full-source refresh. A present selection updates only these Spaces
+// and preserves unselected Spaces, including those from the same source.
+// An empty set is allowed only for a source containing Favorites and no Spaces.
